amily: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">작성 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청완료 버튼을 클릭하지 않아 참여를 못하는 사례가 많이 발생하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">최종 지원을 위해 신청완료 버튼을 반드시 눌러주세요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">② </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">근로지 업무내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">근로기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">위치 등을 반드시 확인 후 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">본인 일정 확인 후 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청 후 개인사정으로 취소하게 될 경우 불이익 발생할 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">③ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">대학 방학시작일 이후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">방학중 집중근로 진행 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">④ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">선발 결과 공개일 이후 근로 전 <b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">반드시 기관 담당자와 연락 후 일정을 확인해야 함</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">근로장학생 선발 결과 공개: 2026. 6. 16.(화)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">이후 확인 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">기관 사정으로 인해 근로 가능한 기관 명단이 변경 될 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255)